              "marks": [],
              "text": "Things to Do in "
            },
            {
              "_key": "5fopddtyv3yn",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "k9s17yzle1zt"
              ],
              "text": "Marsa Matruh"
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [
            {
              "_key": "k9s17yzle1zt",
              "_type": "internalLink",
              "reference": {
                "_ref": "wp-page-58887",
                "_type": "reference"
              }
            }
          ],
          "style": "h2"
        },
        {
          "_key": "000000000003",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000002",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Marsa Matruh, known for its stunning beaches and historical sites, offers a variety of activities for visitors. Here’s a guide to some of the top things to do in Marsa Matruh:"
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "normal"
        },
        {
          "_key": "00000000000f",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000004",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "strong"
              ],
              "text": "Beaches"
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000005",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "strong"
              ],
              "text": "Scenic Beaches"
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000006",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": ": The area west of the town features beautiful beaches with turquoise waters and white sand set against jagged rocks."
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000007",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "strong"
              ],
              "text": "Rommel’s Beach"
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000008",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": ": Close to town and near Rommel’s Cave, this beach is historically significant but less impressive for swimming."
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000009",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "strong"
              ],
              "text": "Cleopatra’s Beach"
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000000a",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": ": Famous for the rock pool where Cleopatra and Anthony are said to have bathed. It’s ideal for swimming and less crowded."
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000000b",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "strong"
              ],
              "text": "Miracle Beach"
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000000c",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": ": Located 25 km from the town, known for its long white sand beach. It’s becoming more popular with tourists, so it might be busier."
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000000d",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "strong"
              ],
              "text": "Social Considerations"
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000000e",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": ": Visitors should be mindful of local customs, especially regarding swimwear on public beaches."
            }
          ],
          "level": 1,
          "listItem": "number",
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "normal"
        },
        {
          "_key": "000000000016",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000010",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "strong"
              ],
              "text": "Diving"
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000011",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Marsa Matruh offers unique diving experiences including exploring a World War II submarine, a sunken cargo ship, and unexploded torpedoes."
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000012",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "The diving sites here are less crowded compared to other "
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000014",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "000000000013"
              ],
              "text": "North Coast"
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000015",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": " locations, providing a more serene underwater experience."
            }
          ],
          "level": 1,
          "listItem": "number",
          "markDefs": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000013",
              "_type": "externalLink",
              "href": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Northern_coast_of_Egypt",
              "newTab": true
            }
          ],
          "style": "normal"
        },
        {
          "_key": "000000000019",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000017",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "strong"
              ],
              "text": "Cultural Note"
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000018",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Social mores in Egypt have evolved, and public beaches might not be as comfortable for women as they were in the past. Foreign women might attract attention, so it’s advisable to be aware of the local culture."
            }
          ],
          "level": 1,
          "listItem": "number",
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "normal"
        },
        {
          "_key": "00000000001b",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "00000000001a",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "In summary, Marsa Matruh is a fantastic destination for beach lovers and history enthusiasts. Whether you’re interested in relaxing on beautiful beaches, exploring historical dive sites, or learning about the local culture and history, Marsa Matruh offers a range of activities that cater to various interests. Cleopatra’s Beach and Miracle Beach are particularly recommended for their scenic beauty and historical significance."
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "normal"
        },
        {
          "_key": "00000000001c",
          "_pendingImage": "https://travel2egypt.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/03/abdalla-tarek-M6uwN5tfy0-unsplash.jpg",
          "_type": "image",
          "alt": [
            {
              "_key": "en",
              "value": "Close-up image of a weathered rock formation against a clear sky"
            }
          ],
          "caption": [
            {
              "_key": "en",
              "value": "A testament to the artistry of erosion, this solitary rock formation reaches upwards, sculpted by time and the elements"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "_key": "00000000001d",
          "_pendingImage": "https://travel2egypt.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/03/osama-elsayed-0ykbuG-Wlv4-unsplash-1.jpg",
          "_type": "image",
          "alt": [
            {
              "_key": "en",
              "value": "A bustling beach scene with people enjoying the sun along a rocky coastline, overlooking vibrant blue waters"
            }
          ],
          "caption": [
            {
              "_key": "en",
              "value": "Where the land meets the sea, a perfect day unfolds under the clear sky"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_key": "es",
      "_type": "object",
      "value": [
        {
          "_key": "000000000001",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "g4afp2dpsosv",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Cosas que hacer en "
            },
            {
              "_key": "tl3uix4s1qer",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "s9s13enwu7rt"
              ],
              "text": "Marsa Matruh"
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [
            {
              "_key": "s9s13enwu7rt",
              "_type": "internalLink",
              "reference": {
                "_ref": "wp-page-58887",
                "_type": "reference"
              }
            }
          ],
          "style": "h2"
        },
        {
          "_key": "000000000005",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000002",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Marsa Matruh, conocida por sus impresionantes playas y lugares históricos, ofrece una gran variedad de actividades para los visitantes."
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000003",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "\n"
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000004",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "He aquí una guía de algunas de las mejores cosas que hacer en Marsa Matruh:"
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "normal"
        },
        {
          "_key": "000000000021",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000006",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "strong"
              ],
              "text": "Playas"
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000007",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "strong"
              ],
              "text": "Playas panorámicas"
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000008",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": ": La zona al oeste de la ciudad "
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000000a",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "cuenta"
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000000b",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": " con hermosas playas de aguas turquesas y arena blanca contra rocas escarpadas."
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000000c",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "strong"
              ],
              "text": "Playa de Rommel"
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000000d",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": ": Cerca de la ciudad y de la Cueva de Rommel, esta playa tiene importancia histórica pero es menos impresionante para nadar."
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000000e",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "strong"
              ],
              "text": "Playa de Cleopatra"
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000000f",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": ": Famosa por la piscina de roca "
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000011",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "000000000010"
              ],
              "text": "donde se dice que"
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000012",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": " se bañaron Cleopatra y Antonio."
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000013",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "\n"
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000014",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Es ideal para nadar y está menos concurrida."
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000015",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "strong"
              ],
              "text": "Playa del Milagro"
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000016",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": ": Situada a 25 km de la ciudad, es conocida por su larga playa de arena blanca."
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000017",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "\n"
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000018",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Cada vez es más popular entre los turistas, "
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000001a",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "por lo que"
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000001b",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": " puede estar más concurrida."
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000001c",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "strong"
              ],
              "text": "Consideraciones sociales"
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000001d",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": ": Los "
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000001f",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "00000000001e"
              ],
              "text": "visitantes"
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000020",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": " deben ser conscientes de las costumbres locales, especialmente en lo que se refiere al bañador en las playas públicas."
            }
          ],
          "level": 1,
          "listItem": "number",
          "markDefs": [
